flowchart TD
  you([Admin]) -->|sign in, 2FA at the proxy| proxy[Login proxy / Basic auth]
  proxy -->|request + Remote-User, Remote-Groups| role{trusted proxy?<br/>admin group?}
  role -->|no| viewer[Viewer<br/>reads only their own account]
  role -->|yes| admin[Admin<br/>reads every account]
  admin -->|Unlock server<br/>with the Ente admin email| code[museum sends a login code]
  code --> pw[code + Ente password + TOTP<br/>token opened with argon2id]
  pw --> mem[Unlocked: token in memory,<br/>locks after 15 min idle<br/>or 60 min]
  mem --> act[Action: preview,<br/>then typed confirmation]
  act -->|confirmed| api[museum admin API call]
  api --> audit[(Audit log<br/>before / after)]

  class you muted
  class proxy,pw,mem auth
  class role,act gate
  class viewer,admin,code,api app
  class audit log
